  <div class="tp-answer" id="quick-answer"><p><strong>Quick answer:</strong> no face is perfectly symmetrical. This test reflects one side of your face across its midline and measures how far each feature lands from its partner. Most people score <strong>80&ndash;95%</strong>; small differences are normal and usually not noticeable.</p></div>

